1756806386","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/f6fc6c5912ed7244551b95da40bc896cf88baf13/ss_f6fc6c5912ed7244551b95da40bc896cf88baf13.600x338.jpg?t=1756806386"}],"short_description":"The Fatum \u2014 a test of your deduction in a world of total control. Interrogate, inspect, pass a verdict. Compare visual details, analyze dossiers, and converse with residents. Your decisions write the finale \u2014 be prepared for the consequences.","steam_appid":3568740,"support_info":{"email":"dreamliftstudios@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}